# Apps Flatpak do Tamagi. Uma linha por app:
#   <remote> <ID> <tipo> <categoria> <tamanho aproximado> <descrição>
# tipo:
#   essencial    instalado sozinho no primeiro boot (tamagi-flatpak-setup), para
#                todos. São pequenos: o mínimo para o desktop ser usável.
#   opcional     oferecido no catálogo (`tamagi install` e primeiro login),
#                desmarcado: o usuário escolhe.
# Navegadores, jogos nativos, máquinas virtuais, caixas de desenvolvimento e
# agentes de IA estão em catalog.tsv (não são só Flatpak).
# Preferência por apps verificados pelo próprio fabricante.
# Remotes: flathub e cosmic (repositório da System76 para o COSMIC).
flathub com.github.tchx84.Flatseal               essencial   Sistema         2MB    Flatseal — permissões dos apps Flatpak
flathub io.github.flattool.Warehouse             essencial   Sistema         2MB    Warehouse — gerenciar apps Flatpak
flathub org.gnome.Loupe                          essencial   Sistema         15MB   Loupe — imagens
flathub org.gnome.Papers                         essencial   Sistema         35MB   Papers — PDF e documentos
cosmic  io.github.cosmic_utils.minimon-applet    essencial   Sistema         5MB    Monitor de CPU e memória na barra
cosmic  io.github.cosmic_utils.weather-applet    essencial   Sistema         5MB    Clima na barra
cosmic  io.github.cosmic_utils.cosmic-ext-applet-clipboard-manager essencial Sistema 5MB Histórico da área de transferência
flathub io.missioncenter.MissionCenter           opcional    System         35MB   Mission Center — system monitor
flathub org.gnome.World.PikaBackup               opcional    System         45MB   Pika Backup — backups to a disk or server
flathub org.onlyoffice.desktopeditors            opcional    Office      1.1GB  OnlyOffice — documents, spreadsheets and presentations
flathub org.libreoffice.LibreOffice              opcional    Office      800MB  LibreOffice — documents, spreadsheets and presentations
flathub org.mozilla.Thunderbird                  opcional    Office      300MB  Thunderbird — email and calendar
flathub com.bitwarden.desktop                    opcional    Office      560MB  Bitwarden — password manager
flathub org.telegram.desktop                     opcional    Communication     260MB  Telegram — messaging
flathub org.signal.Signal                        opcional    Communication     380MB  Signal — encrypted messaging
flathub com.discordapp.Discord                   opcional    Communication     600MB  Discord — voice and communities
flathub com.obsproject.Studio                    opcional    Creative         590MB  OBS Studio — record and stream
flathub org.gimp.GIMP                            opcional    Creative         270MB  GIMP — image editing
flathub org.inkscape.Inkscape                    opcional    Creative         310MB  Inkscape — vector drawing
flathub org.videolan.VLC                         opcional    Creative         150MB  VLC — videos and music
flathub com.spotify.Client                       opcional    Creative         300MB  Spotify — music
flathub com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl              opcional    Games           620MB  Heroic — Epic, GOG and Amazon games
flathub com.usebottles.bottles                   opcional    Games           550MB  Bottles — Windows programs (Wine)
flathub io.podman_desktop.PodmanDesktop          opcional    Development 480MB  Podman Desktop — containers with a GUI
flathub com.ranfdev.DistroShelf                  opcional    Development 10MB   DistroShelf — distrobox boxes with a GUI
flathub dev.zed.Zed                              opcional    Development 250MB  Zed — code editor
flathub dev.edfloreshz.CosmicTweaks              opcional    COSMIC         120MB  COSMIC Tweaks — extra COSMIC settings
flathub io.github.cosmic_utils.Examine           opcional    COSMIC         100MB  Examine — hardware information
flathub dev.edfloreshz.Tasks                     opcional    COSMIC         40MB   Tasks — to-do lists
flathub com.jwestall.Forecast                    opcional    COSMIC         20MB   Forecast — weather
flathub dev.edfloreshz.Calculator                opcional    COSMIC         40MB   Calculator — made for COSMIC
